{"parse":{"title":"技能图鉴库/散射","pageid":1807,"revid":11593,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%95%A3%E5%B0%84&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%95%A3%E5%B0%84&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%95%A3%E5%B0%84&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>散射</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E6.95.A3.E5.B0.84\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"散射\"><b>散射</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" style=\"max-width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"5\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"技能 散射.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/02/mauqwiz60bdn5xhw5sgu1yzvz2eiuqv.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E6%95%A3%E5%B0%84.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/02/mauqwiz60bdn5xhw5sgu1yzvz2eiuqv.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E6%95%A3%E5%B0%84.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/0/02/mauqwiz60bdn5xhw5sgu1yzvz2eiuqv.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />散射\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>2\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>/\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>范围攻击、对地面\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>1-3十字\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓2-↑2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>3X3内\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓2-↑2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（物理伤害）对目标方向<font color=\"red\">3×3</font>区域内所有敌人，造成<font color=\"red\">70%</font>[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">范围伤害</span>]，施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▼移动1\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▼移动1</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"red\">2</font>回合。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 1-3十字 3X3内.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/83/8tmr3u70kqrg3oypy9j6xz1z932k4mx.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-3%E5%8D%81%E5%AD%97_3X3%E5%86%85.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/8/83/8tmr3u70kqrg3oypy9j6xz1z932k4mx.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"90\" data-file-height=\"90\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E9%9C%B2%E8%A5%BF%E4%BA%9A%E9%93%B6%E7%8B%BC%E7%8C%8E%E6%89%8B\" title=\"角色图鉴库/露西亚银狼猎手\"><img alt=\"头像 露西亚银狼猎手.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/0/08/ksmbckz8uaam18jynepmrst4k3vieyi.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">露西亚银狼猎手</font></div>\n</div><div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E8%80%85%E5%BC%93%E5%85%B5\" title=\"角色图鉴库/无法者弓兵\"><img alt=\"头像 无法者弓兵.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/7/76/rke1gepdewctyrl1dyfzhu9yoe5f40g.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">无法者弓兵</font></div>\n</div><div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%BC%A9%E9%AA%91%E5%A3%AB%E2%80%9C%E6%91%A7%E5%9F%8E%E2%80%9D\" title=\"角色图鉴库/弩骑士“摧城”\"><img alt=\"头像 弩骑士“摧城”.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/3/3e/4z4o00qwyjgfm2bcwhu6yimj6qah8j6.